  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So quite a few people who made movies/shorts in VRC used a mod called Freeze Frame. It was an extremely useful mod that allowed you to switch to an avatar, hit a record button and it would record all your movements and animations until you hit stop and you could play it back. Instead of asking several friends to help out as actors and making mistakes, you could get one right and spawn another and another.\nIt made videos like this possible:- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_PF0zYJMbM\nAll of those in there (apart from the ones talking) were all me, just using this mod. Is there any plan to bring creative features like this into the game? I was in the middle of a project when EAC was introduced so I had to stop.",
